  <prompt>
    Update LegalWorkspace (self-consumer) and WorkspaceLayoutWizard (if it consumes the section registry) to import from the new `@spaarke/legal-workspace` package. If task 021 chose re-export strategy (b), the existing LegalWorkspace-internal imports may keep working — verify. If task 021 chose move strategy (a), update all LegalWorkspace-internal imports to point at the new package.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    SPAARKE frontend build-engineer.
  </role>

  <goal>
    Both LegalWorkspace and WorkspaceLayoutWizard build correctly and consume the new shared package. Existing behavior preserved.
  </goal>

